sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor V as Visitor
    participant T as Trusted Surface<br/>/api/agent-nexus/ap2/authorize
    participant A as Shopping agent
    participant M as Merchant
    participant C as Credential provider
    participant P as Payment processor
    V->>T: approves a shopping list and a spending cap
    T->>T: signs open checkout + open payment mandate (SD-JWT, ES256, cnf = agent key)
    T->>A: open mandates
    A->>M: cart within the constraints
    M-->>A: checkout_jwt (signed UCP checkout)
    M-->>A: challenge (nonce)
    C-->>A: challenge (nonce)
    A->>A: closes both mandates with its key (kb+sd-jwt, sd_hash, aud, nonce)
    A->>C: open ~~ closed payment mandate
    alt a constraint fails
        C-->>A: unresolved_constraint + payment_receipt (Error)
        A-->>V: back to the Trusted Surface: approve this exact order (human present)
    else every check passes
        C-->>A: payment credential
        A->>M: open ~~ closed checkout mandate
        M-->>A: checkout_receipt (Success)
        M->>P: payment credential + payment mandate
        P-->>M: payment_receipt (Success, simulated)
        T-->>V: authorised: every token, every check, both receipts
    end
